/*
 * EmitShell.h.ct - the .c/.h shell writers (v1-PH-2 S8 shell LModule-ization).
 *
 * The per-unit body writer (`emit_unit_body`), the header writer
 * (`write_unit_header` / `write_unit_header_body`) and the instance / ADT /
 * Box glue they place moved out of `Emitter.h.ct` here. The host keeps only the
 * program entry, the `EmitOps` methods and the `ct_emit_*` bindings; the shell
 * reads the writer identity (`LModulePlan.shell_u` / `shell_header`) and the
 * built-in include list from the plan instead of unit-scope host globals.
 *
 * Bodies are byte-identical to the ones `Emitter.h.ct` held; the `Emitter`
 * type and the `EmitShell` declaration live in EmitterCore.h.ct, so this unit
 * imports Core and the sibling emit units, and the import graph stays acyclic.
 *
 * License: same as the rest of the compiler (see LICENSE / LICENSE.EXCEPTION).
 */

